title: 'parachains/disputes: remove the dead ValidatorSetCounts storage item'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    `ValidatorSetCounts` in the slashing pallet was never read or written anywhere in the
    codebase. The value it would have cached is always computed fresh where it's needed instead.
    Since nothing ever wrote to it, there's no on-chain data to clean up, so this just removes
    the declaration.
crates:
- name: polkadot-runtime-parachains
  bump: patch
